# 统一按 LF 存入库，避免 Windows（core.autocrlf=true）与 Linux/macOS 之间
# 因行尾差异产生「整文件 diff」的噪声提交。见 devlog/待办事项.md P0-07。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 这些文件天然是二进制，禁止任何行尾转换与文本 diff
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.node binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# 锁文件不参与 diff 统计，避免污染 PR 的体积视图
package-lock.json -diff linguist-generated

# PowerShell 脚本按 CRLF 落地，避免部分 Windows 工具链解析异常
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
